    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Pascale Chouinard",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109652992568657690478/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXEaSV7uxcejKTWRwNrUAN7yG6isezHx2LyCjVAUhWIspTjUoQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "I had my first pedicure yesterday with Rathana. The salon is welcoming and well maintained. You can tell the owner has a lot of pride in her business. Rathana was very meticulous and gave me a beautiful pedicure. My toes are ready for the beach. I highly recommend this adorable salon 🌟",
        "time": 1768654830,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Marie Lauzon",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114523607995289986150/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJIRkuiX1V-NANGjvTOtSd8ytKr7HAbzAYhWk8tO7C5mRg67_4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "This place is amazing!\n\nI tried it for the first time, since I was unsatisfied at my previous salon where I’ve been going for the last 2 years.\n\nI got gel manicure and pedicure, the two ladies were so kind, gentle with my nails and did an amazing job, no waiting, they speak french and english.\n\nI strongly recommend this place.",
        "time": 1660844303,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Sandy Pinchevsky",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116804773673560943131/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKmcYjYV4D7Nf9N2uBHLtl1FdKbq4BYVHRcpE7gBYx6hDCRbA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Very nice ladies but not great pedi/mani, barely pushed back cuticles. I asked not to cut cuticles.  They use inferior polish. Mani lasted less than 24 hrs and pedi lasted less than two weeks! I watched them use a drill to remove  someone’s shellac!! So opted for regular polish.",
        "time": 1661133658,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nancy",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102013888295183850783/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI7QfatqZxApopAUAlZA___0jKQX2a18L54O9Tu1xD6BBUzyg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "They do not clean properly their tools: I have fungus on my toe, when I noticed, I showed them and they insisted it was nothing!! Doctor prescribed 6\nMonth treatment and confirmed what it was and how contagious it is!\nMy friend continued to go to same place, noticed a spot on her nail and allowed them to do her nails anyways. Major infection and needed medical treatment! NOT RECOMMENDED",
        "time": 1682725446,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Benjamin Rousse",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100004532342088890445/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKzViiVRPmBDMeLJTVqV-XMLEht4Hnpkf377Oye6z-XR8HG-Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Had appointment at 12:15 for 2 people and 13:15 for 1 people. Second appointment only started at 14:15. Spend 3 hours total, and when said that I had appointment at 13:15, lady started to raise her voice and said I should leave if I don’t want it. Quite the bad experience.",
        "time": 1722890434,
        "translated": false
      }
